&lt;p&gt;Republic Transmission, LLC borrowed $600k from the revolving credit facility authorized in FERC Docket No. ES25-67-000.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock>
