  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="HHEBA1CD44839C108D1DAFD6DE3427BE45" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;8. None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="HH22FBAEA0509E80B804A4341B1670898A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;9. The following occurred during Q2 2026:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Request for Update to Formula Rate Depreciation Rates, Docket No. ER26-2758 (filed June 8, 2026) (updating depreciation rates in formula rate).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock id="HH582A4E700260C05D782FA2D6F218758A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;10. None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantChangesRelatedToRespondentCompanyAppearingInAnnualReportToStockholdersTextBlock id="HHFB056E8F64ABA7B86B31B31B7725CE20" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;12. Not Applicable&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantChangesRelatedToRespondentCompanyAppearingInAnnualReportToStockholdersTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="HHC9E9219375AC2F82A8CDFAF00D88FECC" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;13. The following occurred during Q2 2026:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Darren Thomas appointed Managing Director;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rebecca Beckham appointed as Vice President &amp;amp; Controller.&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock id="HHD790CCB2EDB33AB49E3957CEAFD4E7D7" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;14. None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;"&gt;REPUBLIC TRANSMISSION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;"&gt;, LLC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;"&gt;Notes to Financial Statements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27.35pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;(1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt; and Basis of Presentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 54.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -40.85pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;(a)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Republic &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Transmission,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; LLC (Republic) was formed as a limited &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;liability &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;company on April 14, 2008. The Company was owned b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;y Republic Transmission Holdings, LLC (Republic Holdings). The Company was formed to develop, own, and operate transmission in the system operated by the Midcontinent System Operator (MISO). In December 2016, MISO designated the Company as the selected developer for the Duff to Coleman Project (the Project) in a competitive solicitation process due to the Company&amp;#8217;s proposal having the strongest combination of attributes. The Project is an approximately 31 mile single-circuit 345 kV transmission line to connect the existing Duff substation in Indiana to the existing Coleman extra-high voltage substation in Kentucky. The Project was completed and placed into commercial operations on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;June 11&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, 2020.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 54.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -40.85pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;(b)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Basis of Presentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8217;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;s financial statements and accompanying notes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;were&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;prepared&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;accordance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC) as set forth in its applicable Uniform System of Accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.9pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.8pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;published&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.95pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.8pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;releases,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.9pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;which&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.85pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.8pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.9pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;comprehensive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.9pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;basis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.85pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.8pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.85pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;other&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.95pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;than U.S.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;generally&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;accepted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;principles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;(U.S. GAAP).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.75pt 6pt 36pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The primary differences between the Company's FERC financial statements and U.S. GAAP financial statements are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.05pt 12.8pt 0pt 54pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;a)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Accumulated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;removal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;reported&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;accumulated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;depreciation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;FERC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;purposes (U.S. GAAP requires that cost of removal be classified as a regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;liability);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.95pt 0pt 54pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;b)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;There is no current liability classification of the current portion of long-term debt; and deferred financing costs are reported separately in the FERC balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.8pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;sheet;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.9pt 0pt 54pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;c)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The presentation of regulatory assets and regulatory liabilities in the balance sheet under U.S. GAAP requirements differs from FERC requirements;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.8pt 0pt 54pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;d)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The inclusion of income taxes as a component of the FERC financial statements pursuant to the FERC&amp;#8217;s Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowances, rather than the exclusion of income taxes pursuant to U.S. GAAP due to the Company&amp;#8217;s treatment as a flow through entity; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.8pt 0pt 54pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;e)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;A portion of Member&amp;#8217;s equity for U.S. GAAP reporting purposes is included in Accumulated Deferred Income Taxes for FERC reporting purposes. However, the Members pay income taxes on their allocated share of the Company&amp;#8217;s income and for purposes herein, those taxes are calculated using the federal corporate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;rate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.8pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 40.5pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;These financial statements and notes reflect the Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8217;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;s evaluation of events occurring &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;subsequent to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; the accompanying&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;balance sheet dates &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;through August 31, 2026, the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; date the Company filed this report with FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27.35pt; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;(2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Regulatory Matters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; has received FERC approval to use a company-specific, forward-looking &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;or projected &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;formula&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; framework in setting its transmission rates. These &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;projected&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; rates are updated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; annually&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; with forecasted information. An annual reconciliation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; or true-up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, which &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;calculates the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; revenue requirement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; using actual data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;is used to adjust the projected &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;rates in a subsequent year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 54.7pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -45.7pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;(a)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Formula Rate Items&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 31.5pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;On June 1, 2026, the Company published its formula rate true-up, calculating the true-up adjustment for rate year 2025. The calculated over-recovery, including interest, will adjust the projected ATRR for rate year 2027.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 31.5pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 31.5pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;On June 8, 2026, in FERC Docket No. ER26-2758, the Company submitted a request for authorization to adjust the depreciation rates for certain accounts in the Company&amp;#8217;s Formula Rate Template. On August 26, 2026, the Commission issued an order accepting the new depreciation rates effective September 1, 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 31.5pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27.35pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;(3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Financing Arrangements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;In the first six months of 2026, the Company issued long-term debt totaling $0.6 million and made a principal repayment of $0.03 million on its term loan, resulting in total outstanding long-term debt of $25.2 million as of June 30, 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27.35pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;(4)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;M&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;embers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#8217;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt; Equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Profit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, losses and distributions are allocated in accordance with the provisions of the Company&amp;#8217;s &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;L&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;imited &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;L&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;iability agreement. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;In 2026, total equity distributions from the Company were $0.4 million. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
